Mnemoloci

The write-safety engine in mnemoloci/core/ (vault lock, atomic writes,
plan-approval hashing, transaction journal and recovery) is a path-only
reimplementation of algorithms from claude-obsidian and from our
native-Windows fork of it (claude-obsidian-win, branch windows-native-writes).

